    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken the Savannah! Years ago humans drove the animals away. Will you bring life to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >its stunning plains again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coax mighty creatures back to their home, learn from the wise ranger, build your cabin, and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >embark on magical handpan missions as you play through the levels and explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this open world. You might even unearth the legend of the atlas bear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your equipment and tools to photograph, collect items and find hidden sheet music for the handpan and lure legendary animals. Take control of the unique and cosy <strong>base building system</strong> whilst building sanctuaries for  animals unlocked through completing various tasks and missions.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken the Savannah! Years ago humans drove the animals away. Will you bring life to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >its stunning plains again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coax mighty creatures back to their home, learn from the wise ranger, build your cabin, and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >embark on magical handpan missions as you play through the levels and explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this open world. You might even unearth the legend of the atlas bear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your equipment and tools to photograph, collect items and find hidden sheet music for the handpan and lure legendary animals. Take control of the unique and cosy <strong>base building system</strong> whilst building sanctuaries for  animals unlocked through completing various tasks and missions.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Your cozy expedition awaits! Get ready to set up camp and wander the beautiful landscape, helping animals find their way home during your creature-collecting sandbox adventure. Craft useful items, build your base, there\u2019s so much to do here.",
